From b4c188d0b48c03d4b7968eed47ceffafaf04f08b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hades <15710513+hadesdevls@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 01:02:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] the files that Hades adds say whose they are

The source files that this project added to Kodi were given Kodi's own
header: "Copyright (C) <year> Team Kodi" and "This file is part of
Kodi". Team Kodi did not write them, and they are not in Kodi. They now
name their author and say where they are from.

Only the files that a commit of this project added (thirteen). The files
that authors of Kodi added, in the commits taken from Kodi's own branch,
are theirs and keep their headers. The licence line of each file, GPL
2.0 or later, is unchanged. No code changes.
